--- !u!1001 &309895994
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 103749566}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 313948706270051055, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: ATHLETES ARE PROTESTING
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2659459170781084179, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Tensions between runners and officials reached a new level yesterday
        as dozens of athletes gathered outside the central racing grounds to protest
        what they describe as an unreasonable testing regime.\nThe competitors claim
        they are being inspected so frequently that they can barely concentrate on
        their training. According to several runners, athletes are now required to
        undergo examinations before races, after races, and sometimes without warning
        during training sessions.\n\u201CWe understand the need for fair competition,\u201D
        said one protester, \u201Cbut there comes a point when a runner spends more
        time being tested than actually running.\u201D"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3198379244358998073, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -9.09
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3277410486866434425, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: JournaleUI4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3277410486866434425, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4702836190640835036, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -18.02
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5402518102195765066, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: SWIMMER DOMINATES SUMMER MEETING
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6059964909105023899, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.y
      value: -6.03
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6109735740334789137, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The Racing Committee has defended the policy, arguing that the increased
        inspections are necessary because of the recent wave of scandals involving
        performance-enhancing substances.

        The protest remained peaceful
        for most of the afternoon, although tempers reportedly rose when officials
        announced that additional testing would be introduced for major competitions.

        Some
        athletes have threatened to boycott upcoming events if the policy is not
        reconsidered. Officials, however, appear unwilling to reduce the inspections.

        With
        both sides refusing to surrender, the relationship between competitors and
        the newly appointed regulator may become one of the biggest stories of the
        season.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6109735740334789137, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_margin.w
      value: 0.47521973
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8021706265186088782, guid: a21a9ca0325425f42ae2532455c4dfb6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Pivot.x
